{90}{The last person I buried was Professor Siegfried. He had not left a will and his belonging were distributed among the people present at the funeral: the antique dealer, the castellan, the gardener. Each got something according to their ranks. If my memories are good, there was a high quality helmet, some valuable gloves and a precious pendant...}{The last person I buried was Professor Siegfried. He had not left a will and his belonging were distributed among the people present at the funeral: the antique dealer, the castellan, the gardener. Each got something according to their ranks. If my memories are good, there was a high quality helmet, some valuable gloves and a precious pendant...}{}{}{}{ru1500}
